  "title": "Marinated Mushrooms with Blue Cheese",
  "description": "This is easy, delicious and a huge hit a parties. Everyone always asks for the recipe! Mushrooms are marinated in a zesty oil and vinegar mixture. Adjust the amount of mushrooms so that all are covered in liquid while marinating.",
